{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Riemann–Roch 定理”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Riemann--Roch定理"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>复分析中, Riemann–Roch 定理描述了给定零点与可能极点的亚纯函数空间的维数. 它将紧 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann面","text":"Riemann 面"}},{"Plain":"上的复分析与其"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑亏格","text":"亏格"}},{"Plain":"联系起来.</p>\n<p>Riemann–Roch 定理将代数或解析簇 $X$ 上局部自由层 $E$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":"表示为 $E$ 与 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"示性类","text":"示性类"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Riemann–Roch 定理与 "},{"Local":{"url":"Mittag-Leffler问题","text":"Mittag-Leffler 问题"}},{"Plain":"有关.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>对"},{"Local":{"url":"亏格","text":"亏格"}},{"Plain":"为 $g$ 的紧"},{"Local":{"url":"曲线","text":"Riemann 面"}},{"Plain":" $C$ 上的全纯向量丛 $E$,\n$$\r\n\\chi(C,E) = \\deg(E) + \\operatorname{rk}(E)(1-g).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对"},{"Local":{"url":"正则","text":"正则性"}},{"Plain":"射影曲线 $C$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"除子","text":"除子"}},{"Plain":" $D=\\sum a_{p}\\cdot (p)$, 定义 $\\deg D=\\sum a_p \\deg p$,\n$$\r\n\\chi(C,\\mathcal O_C(D))=\\deg D + \\chi(C,\\mathcal O_C).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对"},{"Local":{"url":"亏格","text":"亏格"}},{"Plain":"为 $g$ 的紧 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann面","text":"Riemann 面"}},{"Plain":" $M$ 上的任意"},{"Local":{"url":"除子","text":"除子"}},{"Plain":" $D$, $H^\\bullet(M,\\mathcal{O}_D)$ 均为有限维, 且\n$$\r\n\\chi(H^\\bullet(M,\\mathcal{O}_D)) -\\deg D= 1-g.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>推广</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Hirzebruch--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}